the-firm-as-one-program-10 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-10 = unlines (cons "- **O7** Nothing in computer science is not developed fully at firms like Citadel Securities and Jane Street; this was the three-year study of the industry before execution. Optimization, end-to-end optimization." (cons "  - **O7.1** You can only optimize across a boundary whose two sides you can relate. Today every boundary blocks optimization: team to team, language to language, process to process, software to silicon." (cons "  - **O7.2** The optimum of the whole is not the sum of local optima, so the firm is locally optimal and globally wasteful." (cons "  - **O7.3** With the whole firm as one program, computable equality to swap representations and specialization that carries proofs, strategy, parser, NIC and photon are optimized as one object. [C4: The fast path is a specialization that carries its proof ([P5], [P7])], [C15: Network and FPGA are targets of the same program ([P7])], [S1: The gains multiply instead of adding, which changes the firm's rate of learning (all of layer 3)]" nil))))
